# Project Rules Override

For this project (OnCallWeb), do NOT follow the rigid global developer guidelines/rules regarding:
- Forced Laravel-style MVC controllers and packages (`@qubitcodes/qcrouter`, `@qubitcodes/qcreq`, `@qubitcodes/qcresp`).
- Strict controller separations where API routes only parse and redirect.
- Strict database conventions unless they are already present in the existing code.

This project is a modification of an existing codebase. Always respect the existing architecture, files, and patterns. Keep the existing Next.js 15 (App Router) pages, layouts, and data fetch patterns.
